WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
- Well let's get the show though y'all.

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.630
I'm so excited. We love
when this guest comes by.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.910
I personally do. Not only,
is he arguably the most

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.940
successful solo musical act in history,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.120
proven by stats, he is
also a man of the people.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.710
He's just so cool and down to earth.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.050
If you haven't seen one of his shows live,

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.391
shame on you.

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:18.224
(laughter)

00:00:18.224 --> 00:00:20.340
It's been a minute. You've
had time to see shows.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.870
You need to fix that like right now.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.400
But if you have seen him live,

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.057
you know why I'm obsessed with him.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:28.530
He is the ultimate
performer, in a big arena or

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.910
a small venue, both ways.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:31.710
