00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:37.438
(applause)

00:00:37.438 --> 00:00:40.440
You gotta see it. It's called
"Garth Brooks Plus One."

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.565
Everyone give it up for Garth Brooks.

00:00:42.565 --> 00:00:44.815
(applause)

00:00:46.044 --> 00:00:48.532
(upbeat music)

00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:50.782
(cheering)

00:01:20.926 --> 00:01:22.816
- Very sweet.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.754
- They got me. They got me.

00:01:24.754 --> 00:01:26.812
Did you see me pull up, turn around?

00:01:26.812 --> 00:01:29.083
I go, "Garth Brooks." (Kelly laughs)

00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.247
I was like "Nope." (Kelly laughs)

00:01:30.247 --> 00:01:31.095
- Nope. Come in there.

00:01:31.095 --> 00:01:32.080
- I did not know you came from there.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.170
- First time we ever did your
show, we came from there.

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.060
- We did. I know.

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.084
- We did. I about fell on
my ass down the stairs.

00:01:37.084 --> 00:01:39.480
- I think someone definitely
told- I about ran out

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:42.300
