cause it's- That's a big song.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.133
Would you like to have a seat?

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:43.979
- It was good.

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:44.812
- Or we can stand the whole time?

00:01:44.812 --> 00:01:45.645
- I'll sit when you sit.

00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:46.478
(both laugh)

00:01:46.478 --> 00:01:47.311
- Or we could stand the whole time.

00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:48.870
You're a gentleman. I like it. I like it.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:49.920
You look so handsome.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.580
- You're very sweet. Thank you.

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.797
(cheering)

00:01:52.797 --> 00:01:56.430
Can I explain the hat or not the hat?

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.263
- Oh you can.

00:01:57.263 --> 00:01:59.160
- Can I? Yes, cause I
always wear a hat, ball cap.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.878
I was going to wear a ball
cap, probably a Circle G cap.

00:02:00.878 --> 00:02:02.150
