00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:06.916
- Yeah.

00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:09.960
- And she really worked on my hair, right?

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.400
- Because I don't have any
hair. - It's really great.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.477
- So she really worked on it and I said,

00:02:13.477 --> 00:02:15.210
"If I wear ball- She goes
'You wear a ball cap,

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.043
I'll kill ya."

00:02:16.043 --> 00:02:17.563
(both laugh)

00:02:17.563 --> 00:02:19.150
- You comin- You look all
dapper. I like this look.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.723
- Thank you very much.

00:02:20.723 --> 00:02:21.556
(applause)

00:02:21.556 --> 00:02:23.210
- I think I've seen you
all different ways so

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.530
it didn't even cross my
mind. Cowboy hat, ball cap.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.030
Cause last time we saw
each other, I think you-

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.198
Were you wearing a ball
cap? I think in the studio.

00:02:28.198 --> 00:02:30.570
- Yep. - Yeah. Anyway, I
wanna get to this though cause

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.720
this is the coolest hosting
thing I've ever seen happen.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.080
So you and Dolly, ACM
Awards. Y'all just hosted the

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.809
ACM Awards together. That is incredible.

00:02:38.809 --> 00:02:40.797
(cheering)

00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.830
I mean I've kinda-

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.610
I was thinking back in my
memory banks and I don't know

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.810
if I've ever really seen
y'all do something together.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.710
- Never have. I was scared to death.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.620
- What. Which is crazy to me.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.540
