of four foot eleven and

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.130
she looks like she's
eight foot tall when you

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.200
meet her, right.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.033
- Oh I love- yeah I love her.

00:02:58.033 --> 00:02:59.490
- And that picture- you
just showed the picture.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.920
I feel I need to explain that picture.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:05.254
The very first photo
we took together, she-

00:03:05.254 --> 00:03:06.687
Would you stand up with me, sorry? - Yes.

00:03:06.687 --> 00:03:08.310
- The very first photo she put together.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:10.470
She turns like this and
then she grabs both of

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:12.829
