00:03:12.829 --> 00:03:13.780
- Oh you're going to prom?

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:14.613
- Oh.

00:03:14.613 --> 00:03:15.446
(audience laughs)

00:03:15.446 --> 00:03:16.350
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:17.861
That wasn't what I was thinking.

00:03:17.861 --> 00:03:20.198
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:20.198 --> 00:03:21.540
So I- She goes, "You can place them here,"

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.700
I said, "No I can't," and
then we started laughing.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.100
And that was the shot that they used.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.660
- Well, I don't know if you've noticed but

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.490
there's a little difference
with me and Dolly.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.195
So my mind didn't go there.

00:03:31.195 --> 00:03:33.420
(both laugh)

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.509
God didn't bless this.

00:03:34.509 --> 00:03:35.790
(Garth laughs)

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.260
Blessed so much, you know.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:39.240
So wait, so Dolly has said
that when you're together,

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.070
you're the more serious one. Do you agree?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:41.903
- Oh yeah.

00:03:41.903 --> 00:03:44.197
- Yeah? - She's so cool. They
were up there and they go,

00:03:44.197 --> 00:03:46.140
"Okay we're going to photos, right."

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.990
And photos aren't boom, boom.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.060
Now photos are just
boom, boom, boom, boom.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.910
And I swear to God man once
they go "Okay here goes."

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.169
Boom. Boom. Boom. (chuckles). Boom. Ha.

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:57.002
(kelly laughs and claps)

00:03:57.002 --> 00:03:59.092
You know that kind of thing, right.

00:03:59.092 --> 00:04:03.180
And I'm like Holy (bleep).
What am I going to do, right?

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.270
And so when go "Okay,
photos here we go." Boom.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.725
Boom. Boom.

00:04:07.725 --> 00:04:08.558
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:08.558 --> 00:04:11.610
Boom. That's all it was. All
it was just chins for days.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.520
It was like "Ugh this is
horrible." She's fabulous.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.610
- You just described
me and Blake Shelton at

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.987
The Voice photo shoot.
I am literally like,

00:04:19.987 --> 00:04:21.360
"What will get me out of here?"

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.880
And I'm like, "Oh my god. Ha. Ha. Ha. Ha."

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.200
I'm like the whole time everyone-

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.000
And he literally, in
every photo, was like,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.060
hands in pockets, like very Oklahoma.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.450
It's amazing. But she is
very nonchalant though,

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.610
I will say being around
her, like in environments,

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:38.160
like working environments. She calms you.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.830
She's like a very calming
spirit. I like that about her.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.710
- Yeah well I mean she's
a leader. A born leader.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.561
- Such a little leader. Yeah.

00:04:45.561 --> 00:04:49.350
- She is- It's- I guess
when they say it's how big

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.290
is your heart. She's
taller than I am for sure.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:55.530
She's- She's an amazing person.
And think about this, okay.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:57.660
Every single you know
from Dolly, every single.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.493
- Yeah.

00:04:58.493 --> 00:04:59.326
- She wrote.

00:04:59.326 --> 00:05:00.159
- I know.

00:05:00.159 --> 00:05:02.141
- That's impossible, first of all.

00:05:02.141 --> 00:05:03.025
- I know.

00:05:03.025 --> 00:05:05.250
