00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:21.817
- Jolene. And to have Jolene
this woman talking about,

00:05:21.817 --> 00:05:23.010
"You're going to take my man," and

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.780
you look like Dolly Parton.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.130
