00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:30.180
- Right? Exactly. So the- the- the

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.440
tenderness or the fragileness

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.470
she shows in there and when
she's sings it you believe it?

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:35.520
- Yeah. A story teller.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.353
- That's- She's unbelievable and-

00:05:36.353 --> 00:05:38.040
- That's what great though.
That's why I hadn't-

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.510
Y'all hadn't done this- Y'all hadn't done

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:40.770
anything together which
struck me cause you're both

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.497
